{"id":"n82343-1-8","stage":5,"title":"파묻다 · 掩埋","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82343-1-8-1","ko":"우리도 이제 곧 김장을 해야겠어.","zh":"我们也快该腌越冬泡菜了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"김장을","meaning":"腌菜，腌辛奇","explanation":"김장：腌菜，腌辛奇；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"김장","audio":"/audio/68de8ca9389d033ce19b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45128","senseId":"1","lemma":"김장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김장을","audio":"/audio/8bf97c22735859d3aa1b.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠어","audio":"/audio/3114ef489ad78871250b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"68de8ca9389d033c","term":"김장","zh":"腌菜，腌辛奇","audio":"/audio/68de8ca9389d033ce19b.mp3","entryId":"45128","definition":"深秋时节，为满足整个冬天所需，一次性大量腌制辛奇；或指那样腌制的辛奇。","pronunciation":["김장"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d5221d8335dcec16ad9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82343-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 주말에 김장독을 땅속에 파묻어야겠군.","zh":"那周末得把泡菜缸埋到地里了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주말에","audio":"/audio/ff068f34f21f5a2dea38.mp3"}},{"text":"김장독을","meaning":"辛奇缸","explanation":"김장독：辛奇缸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"김장독","audio":"/audio/c3ab4bb63698e90bc03d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45131","senseId":"1","lemma":"김장독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김장독을","audio":"/audio/2d71db52ee10ebfb7b93.mp3"}},{"text":"땅속에","meaning":"地，地下","explanation":"땅속：地，地下；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"땅속","audio":"/audio/d4d9865b3fa78d46263b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15120","senseId":"1","lemma":"땅속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅속에","audio":"/audio/7b3f319bf70467351553.mp3"}},{"text":"파묻어야겠군.","meaning":"掩埋","explanation":"파묻다：掩埋；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"파묻다","audio":"/audio/dde99151debbab825d1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82343","senseId":"1","lemma":"파묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파묻어야겠군","audio":"/audio/64904f53ff8afde12beb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"c3ab4bb63698e90b","term":"김장독","zh":"辛奇缸","audio":"/audio/c3ab4bb63698e90bc03d.mp3","entryId":"45131","definition":"用来存放深秋时腌制而整个冬天要吃的辛奇的大缸。","pronunciation":["김장똑"]},{"id":"d4d9865b3fa78d46","term":"땅속","zh":"地，地下","audio":"/audio/d4d9865b3fa78d46263b.mp3","entryId":"15120","definition":"地的下面。","pronunciation":["땅쏙"]},{"id":"dde99151debbab82","term":"파묻다","zh":"掩埋","audio":"/audio/dde99151debbab825d1c.mp3","entryId":"82343","definition":"挖开埋到里面。","pronunciation":["파묻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0718b9c9a2520890b16a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.351,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82343","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1777,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们也快该腌越冬泡菜了。","那周末得把泡菜缸埋到地里了。","水泥地面上还留着运动鞋的痕迹呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们也快该腌越冬泡菜了。","那周末得把泡菜缸埋到地里了。","水泥地面上还留着运动鞋的痕迹呢。"],"answer":1}]}
